#, machine, plain1
msgid "A <strong>member bot</strong> needs its member to run it, with a key for their own script (for example for X) or a paid source: it stays theirs and says who runs it."
msgstr "A <strong>locekļa bot</strong> ir nepieciešams tās dalībnieks, lai vadītu to, ar atslēgu savu skriptu (piemēram, X) vai maksas avots: tas paliek savējo un saka, kas vada to."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A <strong>site bot</strong> runs on free feeds (RSS, Atom or JSON feeds from news sites, YouTube channels, Bluesky, Mastodon, Reddit, Substack and many more): anyone can propose one, and once approved it is the site's, run by the admins and linked to nobody."
msgstr "A <strong>bot</strong> darbojas uz brīvas barības (RSS, Atom vai JSON ziņas no ziņu vietām, YouTube kanāli, Bluesky, Mastodon, Reddit, Substack un daudz vairāk): ikviens var ierosināt vienu, un pēc apstiprināšanas tas ir vieta ir, vada admins un saistīts ar nevienam."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A Circle guild is always private."
msgstr "Circle ģilde vienmēr ir privāta."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A Circle guild is private for good: only its members see it, and they post straight into it, so what they write does not appear on their own profiles. You invite members free, or set a price in coins to join, and the coins go to you. This can't be changed later."
msgstr "Circle ģilde ir privāta par labu: tikai tās locekļi to redz, un tie post taisni tajā, tāpēc tas, ko viņi raksta, neparādās uz saviem profiliem. Jūs aicināt biedrus bezmaksas, vai noteikt cenu monētas pievienoties, un monētas iet pie jums. Vēlāk to nevar mainīt."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A Curation is your own named collection of guilds and accounts - like a custom feed, with an algorithm you choose. Keep it private just for yourself, or make it public so others can follow or fork it."
msgstr "Kurināta barotne ir jūsu paša nosauktā ģilžu un kontu kolekcija - kā pielāgota barotne ar izvēlēto algoritmu. Saglabājiet to privāti par sevi, vai darīt to publiski, lai citi varētu sekot vai dakša to."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A QR code to sign in with. Scan it with your phone, where you are signed in."
msgstr "A QR kods, lai pierakstītos ar. Skenējiet to ar tālruni, kur esat pierakstījies."

