msgstr "Tagad to sauc %(name)s."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "It's too late to refuse this code: it has run out or has been used. If you don't recognise a sign-in, log out everywhere, and check your apps too."
msgstr "Ir par vēlu atteikties no šī koda: tas ir beidzies vai ticis izmantots. Ja jūs neatzīstat pierakstīšanos, atvienojiet to visur un pārbaudiet arī savas programmas."

