#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space has ended."
msgstr "Šī telpa ir beigusies."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This Space has ended. Its board is still here to read."
msgstr "Šī telpa ir beigusies. Tā valde joprojām ir šeit lasīt."

#, machine, plain1
