msgstr "Jūsu ģildes"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your inquiry has been saved."
msgstr "Jūsu izmeklēšana ir glābta."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your language"
msgstr "Jūsu valoda"

#. the English uses "sign-ins" for every number
#, machine, plain2, python-format
msgid "Your last %(num)s sign-ins. The place is only the country, worked out from the connection. Don't recognise one? Change your password: that signs out every other device."
msgid_plural "Your last %(num)s sign-ins. The place is only the country, worked out from the connection. Don't recognise one? Change your password: that signs out every other device."
msgstr[0] "Tavas pēdējās %(num)s pierakstīšanās. Vieta ir tikai valsts, izstrādāta no savienojuma. Neatpazīsti? Mainīt paroli: kas atvieno katru citu ierīci."
msgstr[1] "Jūsu pēdējās %(num)s pierakstīšanās. Vieta ir tikai valsts, izstrādāta no savienojuma. Neatpazīsti? Mainīt paroli: kas atvieno katru citu ierīci."
msgstr[2] "Jūsu pēdējās %(num)s izrakstīšanās. Vieta ir tikai valsts, izstrādāta no savienojuma. Neatpazīsti? Mainīt paroli: kas atvieno katru citu ierīci."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your media storage is no longer connected."
msgstr "Jūsu datu nesēju krātuve vairs nav pieslēgta."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your media storage needs connecting again."
msgstr "Jūsu datu nesēju glabāšanai atkal nepieciešams savienojums."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your membership of [+%(guild)s](/+%(guild)s) ended: you didn't have the %(coins)s coins it renews for. You can join again from its page."
msgstr "Jūsu dalība [+%(guild)s](/+%(guild)s beidzās: Jums nebija %(coins)s monētu, kam tā atjaunojas. Jūs varat pievienoties vēlreiz no tās lapā."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your membership will renew again."
msgstr "Jūsu dalība atkal atjaunosies."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your membership won't renew. You keep access until the day you paid to."
msgstr "Tava dalība neatjaunosies. Jūs varat piekļūt līdz dienai, kad samaksājāt."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your message includes a word this guild doesn't allow."
msgstr "Jūsu ziņa ietver vārdu, ko šī ģilde nepieļauj."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your new backup codes are below. The old ones no longer work."
msgstr "Jūsu jaunie rezerves kodu ir zemāk. Vecie vairs nedarbojas."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your new custom RSS Feed Token has been generated."
msgstr "Jūsu jaunā pasūtījuma RSS Ir ģenerēts Feed Token."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your new key. Copy it now: it is not shown again."
msgstr "Tava jaunā atslēga. Kopēt to tagad: tas netiek parādīts vēlreiz."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your original username will always stay reserved for you: <code>%(name)s</code>"
msgstr "Jūsu sākotnējais lietotājvārds vienmēr paliks jums rezervēts: <code>%(name)s</code>"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your other devices have been signed out."
msgstr "Pārējās ierīces ir atvienotas."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your own circles"
msgstr "Jūsu loki"

#. %(who)s is the @handle of the account being added, filled in by the page
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your own circles. %(who)s is not told."
msgstr "Jūsu aprindās. %(who)s nav teikts."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your own mix"
msgstr "Jūsu pašu kombinācija"

#, python-format
msgid "Your own mix ranks the newest %(num)s matching post. 0 switches a part off, 10 makes it count the most."
msgid_plural "Your own mix ranks the newest %(num)s matching posts. 0 switches a part off, 10 makes it count the most."
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your own password"
msgstr "Jūsu parole"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian didn't agree to release your account."
msgstr "Jūsu vecāki vai aizbildnis nepiekrita atbrīvot jūsu kontu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian has been asked to release your account. Nothing changes until they answer."
msgstr "Jūsu vecākiem vai aizbildnim ir lūgts atbrīvot jūsu kontu. Nekas nemainās, kamēr viņi neatbild."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian has turned this off for your account."
msgstr "Jūsu vecāki vai aizbildnis to ir izslēdzis jūsu kontam."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian made this account for you. They can see what you do on the site (your posts, comments, votes, bookmarks, follows, guilds, who you chat with, that your account was reported and your recent sign-ins; the site never shows them what your chats say) and they choose which features are on. You can see which in [Settings > Content](/settings/content). They chose your password: change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security) so that only you know it, because anyone who knows it can sign in as you and read your chats."
msgstr "Tavs tēvs vai aizbildnis to uzskaita. Viņi var redzēt, ko jūs darīt uz vietas (jūsu ziņas, komentāri, balsis, grāmatzīmes, seko, ģildes, kas jūs tērzēt ar, ka jūsu konts tika ziņots un jūsu nesen pierakstīšanās; vietne nekad parāda viņiem, ko jūsu tērzēšana saka) un viņi izvēlas, kuras funkcijas ir par. Jūs varat redzēt, kas [Iestatījumi > Saturs](/settings/content). Viņi izvēlējās savu paroli: mainiet to [Iestatījumi > Drošība](/settings/security), lai tikai jūs to zināt, jo ikviens, kas to zina, var pierakstīties kā jūs un lasīt jūsu tērzēšanas."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your parent or guardian set a new password for your account and you were signed out. Sign in with the new password, then change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security) so that only you know it."
msgstr "Jūsu vecāki vai aizbildnis uzstāda jaunu paroli jūsu kontam, un jūs tika atvienots. Pierakstieties ar jauno paroli, tad mainiet to [Iestatījumi > Drošība](/settings/security), lai tikai jūs to zināt."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian stopped managing your account. It keeps the child lock until you confirm your age in Settings > Content. They chose your password: change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security), or they can still sign in as you."
msgstr "Jūsu vecāki vai aizbildnis pārstāja pārvaldīt jūsu kontu. Tas uztur bērna bloķēšanu, līdz jūs apstiprināt savu vecumu sadaļā Iestatījumi > Saturs. Viņi izvēlējās savu paroli: mainiet to [Iestatījumi > Drošība](/settings/security), vai arī viņi var pierakstīties kā jūs."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian's account was suspended, so yours is suspended until theirs is back."
msgstr "Jūsu vecāku vai aizbildņa konts tika bloķēts, tāpēc jūsu konts tiek apturēts līdz brīdim, kad viņi atgriezīsies."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your password"
msgstr "Jūsu parole"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your password has been changed. Your other devices have been signed out."
msgstr "Jūsu parole ir mainīta. Pārējās ierīces ir atvienotas."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your password meets the requirements."
msgstr "Jūsu parole atbilst prasībām."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your payouts"
msgstr "Jūsu izmaksas"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your phone approved this. Only continue if this is your account."
msgstr "Jūsu telefons to apstiprināja. Turpināt tikai tad, ja tas ir jūsu konts."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your phone said no, so nobody was signed in."
msgstr "Tavs telefons teica nē, tāpēc neviens nebija parakstīts."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your post is listed on your profile either way. Choose My profile to have its comments there too, and add guilds to post it straight into them: each guild gets its own copy with its own votes and comments."
msgstr "Jūsu amats ir minēts savā profilā abos veidos. Izvēlēties Mans profils, lai tās komentārus tur pārāk, un pievienot ģildes, lai ievietotu to tieši viņiem: katra ģilde saņem savu kopiju ar savu balsojumu un komentāriem."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posting history will show here."
msgstr "Jūsu norīkošanu vēsture rādīs šeit."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts are kept out of All."
msgstr "Jūsu amati tiek turēti ārpus visiem."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts can appear in All."
msgstr "Jūsu posts var parādīties visiem."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts from the last 28 days, with what each got (a post and its guild forwards added up). Only you can see this; these are counts, never names."
msgstr "Jūsu posts no pēdējās 28 dienas, ar to, ko katrs dabūja (amats un tā ģilde priekšu saskaitīti). Tikai jūs varat redzēt šo, tie ir svarīgi, nekad nosaukumi."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts stay on your profile and in the feeds of people who follow you, but All leaves them out. Copies you forward to a guild follow that guild's own setting, and anonymous posts always appear in All, so nobody can tell which ones are yours."
msgstr "Jūsu posts palikt uz jūsu profilu un plūsmas cilvēkiem, kas seko jums, bet visi atstāj tos. Kopijas jūs nosūtīt uz ģildes sekot, ka ģildes paša iestatījumu, un anonīms posts vienmēr parādās visiem, lai neviens nevar pateikt, kuri ir jūsu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your profile"
msgstr "Jūsu profils"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your profile details have been updated."
msgstr "Jūsu profila detaļas ir atjauninātas."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your purchase was successful. A receipt will be emailed to you from Paypal."
msgstr "Jūsu pirkums bija veiksmīgs. Kvīts tiks nosūtīts jums no Paypal."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your roles"
msgstr "Jūsu lomas"

#. a notification. %(title)s is the post's title; %(reason)s says why, as a
#. sentence starting in lowercase.
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid ""
"Your scheduled post \"%(title)s\" could not be published: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"It is saved in your drafts, so you can fix it and post it or schedule it again."
msgstr ""
"Jūsu ieplānotais amats \"%(title)s\" nevar tikt publicēts: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"Tas tiek saglabāts jūsu uzmetumi, lai jūs varētu noteikt to un post to vai ieplānot to vēlreiz."

#. a notification about a post with no title. %(reason)s says why, as a
#. sentence starting in lowercase.
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid ""
"Your scheduled post \"Untitled\" could not be published: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"It is saved in your drafts, so you can fix it and post it or schedule it again."
msgstr ""
"Jūsu ieplānotais amats \"Nenosaukts\" nevarēja tikt publicēts: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"Tas tiek saglabāts jūsu uzmetumi, lai jūs varētu noteikt to un post to vai ieplānot to vēlreiz."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your security key"
msgstr "Jūsu drošības atslēga"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your settings have been updated."
msgstr "Jūsu iestatījumi ir atjaunināti."

#, python-format
msgid "Your shared draft couldn't be published: %(error)s [Open the draft](%(link)s)"
msgstr ""

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your shared drafts"
msgstr "Jūsu kopīgie uzmetumi"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your siege failed. One of the guildmasters created or edited a comment in +%(guild)s within the last 60 days. You may try again in 7 days."
msgstr "Jūsu pārņemšanas prasība neizdevās. Viens no ģildes moderatoriem pēdējo 60 dienu laikā izveidoja vai rediģēja komentāru +%(guild)s. Jūs varat mēģināt vēlreiz 7 dienās."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your siege failed. One of the guildmasters had a post forwarded to +%(guild)s, or edited one there, within the last 60 days. You may try again in 7 days."
msgstr "Jūsu pārņemšanas prasība neizdevās. Vienam no ģildes moderatoriem pēdējo 60 dienu laikā bija amats, kas nosūtīts uz +%(guild)s vai rediģēts. Jūs varat mēģināt vēlreiz 7 dienās."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your siege failed. One of the guildmasters has performed a mod action in +%(guild)s within the last 60 days. You may try again in 7 days."
msgstr "Jūsu pārņemšanas prasība neizdevās. Viens no ģildes moderatoriem pēdējo 60 dienu laikā veicis moderatora darbību +%(guild)s. Jūs varat mēģināt vēlreiz 7 dienās."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your story is up for 24 hours."
msgstr "Tavs stāsts ilgst 24 stundas."

#. %(circle)s is the name of a paid circle someone subscribed to
#, python-format
msgid "Your subscription to %(circle)s by [@%(name)s](/@%(name)s) ended: you didn't have the %(coins)s coins it renews for. You can subscribe again from their profile."
msgstr ""

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your subscription will renew again."
msgstr "Jūsu abonements atjaunosies."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your subscription won't renew. You keep access until the day you paid to."
msgstr "Jūsu abonements neatjaunosies. Jūs varat piekļūt līdz dienai, kad samaksājāt."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your subscriptions"
msgstr "Jūsu abonementi"

#, machine, plain2, python-format
msgid "Your suspension has ended. You can use %(site)s as you did before."
msgstr "Jūsu apturēšana ir beigusies. Jūs varat lietot %(site)s kā iepriekš."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your title is the question. %(min)s to %(max)s options, one vote each. The poll can be voted from every forward and repost of this post."
msgstr "Jūsu nosaukums ir jautājums. %(min)s līdz %(max)s iespējas, pa vienai balsij katram. Aptauju var nobalsot katru reizi uz priekšu un repost šo amatu."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your title is the question. Give %(min)s to %(max)s options. People can vote from every forward and repost of this post, once each."
msgstr "Jūsu tituls ir jautājums. Iedod %(min)s %(max)s opcijas. Cilvēki var balsot no katra uz priekšu un repost šo amatu, reizi katram."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your two-factor code"
msgstr "Jūsu divu faktoru kods"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your username is your unique <code>@handle</code>: the address of your profile, and what people mention and search for. Changing it costs 20 Coins and may be done once every 7 days. To change how your name reads without that, use your display name above."
msgstr "Jūsu lietotājvārds ir jūsu unikālais <code>@handle</code>: jūsu profila adrese, un to, ko cilvēki piemin un meklē. Mainot to maksā 20 Monētas, un to var izdarīt reizi 7 dienās. Lai mainītu to, kā jūsu vārds skan bez tā, izmantojiet jūsu displeja nosaukumu iepriekš."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your verification code"
msgstr "Jūsu verifikācijas kods"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your video was uploaded to YouTube, but YouTube is keeping it private because this site's access is still waiting for YouTube's approval. It cannot be shown in a post yet."
msgstr "Jūsu video tika augšupielādēts YouTube, bet YouTube saglabā to privāti, jo šī vietne joprojām gaida YouTube apstiprinājumu. To vēl nevar parādīt amatā."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your vote"
msgstr "Jūsu balsojums"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your word filter is set to Child, which hides these words, so this page doesn't show them."
msgstr "Jūsu vārds filtrs ir iestatīts uz bērnu, kas slēpj šos vārdus, tāpēc šī lapa nerāda tos."

#, python-format
msgid "[@%(name)s](/@%(name)s) joined [+%(guild)s](/+%(guild)s)."
